    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The sky is a language. You were the first to learn the punctuation.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Weatherwise.</strong> You always know the upcoming weather for the next 12 hours within 1 mile, even underground. You have reroll the lowest die on defense checks [TODO(adv-call)] against weather effects (extreme cold, extreme heat, wind, lightning).</p>\n<p><strong>Wind-Read (1/a Soma Break).</strong> When you would take lightning, thunder, or energy damage (cold), you may use your reaction to halve it. The wind shifts as you do.</p>\n<p><strong>Ash-Walker.</strong> You ignore difficult terrain caused by snow, ash, dust, sand, or shifting earth.</p>",
